N        EQU   16
INPUT    EQU   1000
OUT      EQU   1100
KEY      EQU   0:3
LINK     EQU   4:5
         ORIG  3000
START    ENT1  N           L1. Loop on j. j ← N.
         ST1   INPUT(LINK)  L0 ← N.
         STZ   INPUT+N(LINK)  LN ← 0.
         JMP   6F          Go to decrease j.
2H       LD2   INPUT(LINK)  L2. Set up p, q, K. p ← L0.
         ENT3  0           q ← 0.
         LDA   INPUT,1     K ← Kj.
3H       CMPA  INPUT,2(KEY)  L3. Compare K : Kp.
         JLE   5F          To L5 if K ≤ Kp.
4H       ENT3  0,2         L4. Bump p, q. q ← p.
         LD2   INPUT,3(LINK)  p ← Lq.
         J2P   3B          To L3 if p > 0.
5H       ST1   INPUT,3(LINK)  L5. Insert into list. Lq ← j.
         ST2   INPUT,1(LINK)  Lj ← p.
6H       DEC1  1
         J1P   2B          N > j ≥ 1.
         ENT2  0
         LD1   INPUT(LINK)
WALK     LDA   INPUT,1(KEY)
         STA   OUT,2
         INC2  1
         LD1   INPUT,1(LINK)
         J1P   WALK
         HLT
         END   START
